Enterprise AI Knowledge Workspace
=================================
Single-file system for Recruitbots AI — LLM Application Engineer Challenge 3.

A multi-user knowledge platform with:
  • document upload into collections
  • hybrid RAG search and document chat
  • role-based access control on collections and documents
  • agents for report generation and workflow automation
  • structured JSON outputs and evaluation metrics

No fine-tuned models. User-facing text has no machine-origin labels.
"""

